      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOTH BOWERS ACE (3) produced a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 520m behind Prim And Pretty (30.46) in a Grade 4/5. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Can atone. MEPUNGA SHINE (8) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by a nose at Richmond in a handy 22.85 beating Trunkey Chief. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Should be in this for a long way. MR. INFORMANT (2) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish second, beaten 2 lengths (23.08) at Richmond in a Grade 4/5 over 401m. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Hard to beat again. MY GAIN (1) has claims fresh from a recent placing.",
